# The build context for every image is the repository root (docker build -f <Dockerfile> .).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
# Flavour switches for the OTA/client build (VITE_FLAVOR etc.), no secrets — see their own comments.
!apps/mobile/.env.dev
!apps/mobile/.env.prod
.git
.claude
.install-lock
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
e2e/report
e2e/test-results
screenshots
review
.playwright-mcp
**/*.md
